The wind asks and you look to the sky

146
00:16:55,024 --> 00:17:00,524
歩き続けて どこまで ゆこうか
We keep on walking, so where shall we go?

147
00:17:02,024 --> 00:17:11,024
風と いっしょに また 歩き出そう
Together with the wind, let's start walking again

148
