Yeah. The EN live back in February—
its archive is around September 25th, I think.

429
00:54:23,102 --> 00:54:34,542
もうちょっと見れますので、ぜひ、あのそちらも見てください。ありがとうございます！
You can still watch it a bit more,
so please check that out too. Thank you!

